    <string-array name="rank_text">
        <item>You sit in the corner of the hall and watch.</item>
        <item>A hundred things described. They gave you a desk and a lamp.</item>
        <item>Five hundred things. You have keys to the storeroom now.</item>
        <item>Two thousand things. The young ones come to you for advice.</item>
        <item>Five thousand things. Nothing is written off without your signature.</item>
        <item>Twelve thousand things. The museum is yours: from the cellar to the dome.</item>
    </string-array>
