    <string-array name="wing_text">
        <item>The museum begins.</item>
        <item>It was getting crowded in the main block. Now the halls have room to grow.</item>
        <item>A long enfilade with windows on the garden. The best things move in here.</item>
        <item>Under the dome there is room for the exhibition of the week.</item>
        <item>From up here you can see all the years at once.</item>
        <item>The museum is built. All that’s left is to walk in it.</item>
    </string-array>
